flowchart LR
    User([User / Listener])
    Interface[Music App Interface]
    Profile[(User Taste Profile)]
    Catalog[(Song Catalog)]

    Agent[Agent - MusicRecommender]
    Retriever[Retriever - hybrid tags + Voyage embeddings]
    SpecializedModel[[Specialized Model - trained taste-affinity regressor]]
    LLM[[Claude API - explanation generation]]
    Evaluator{Reliability Evaluator - runtime fallback checks}
    Output[Ranked Recommendations with Explanations]
    Feedback[User Feedback Loop]
    Tester[[Automated Tester - pytest and reliability checks]]

    User -->|1 describes taste| Interface
    Interface --> Profile

    Profile -->|2 taste profile| Agent
    Catalog -->|3 song catalog| Agent
    Agent -->|4a delegates retrieval| Retriever
    Agent -->|4b delegates audio-fit prediction| SpecializedModel
    Retriever -->|5a evidence and semantic scores| Agent
    SpecializedModel -->|5b predicted audio-feature fit| Agent

    Agent -->|6 evidence plus profile| LLM
    LLM -->|7 generated explanation| Agent

    Evaluator -.->|checks each AI call, falls back gracefully on failure| Retriever
    Evaluator -.->|checks each AI call, falls back gracefully on failure| SpecializedModel
    Evaluator -.->|checks each AI call, falls back gracefully on failure| LLM

    Agent -->|8 ranked list| Output
    Output --> Interface
    Interface -->|9 shows results| User

    User -->|10 accepts or refines taste| Feedback
    Feedback --> Profile

    Tester -.->|verifies correctness, consistency, and graceful degradation| Retriever
    Tester -.->|verifies correctness, consistency, and graceful degradation| SpecializedModel
    Tester -.->|verifies correctness, consistency, and graceful degradation| Agent

    subgraph Pipeline [AI Pipeline]
        Agent
        Retriever
        SpecializedModel
        LLM
        Evaluator
    end

    subgraph HumanLoop [Human Checkpoint - Runtime]
        User
        Feedback
    end

    subgraph TestLoop [Automated Testing - Dev Time]
        Tester
    end
